 1472 2766 ~                ; the larger's significand left in fpa -- b's put there when b is the larger -- and the
 1473 2766 ~                ; smaller's in DEHL for the shift. Anything else goes the general way below, everything stored
 1474 2766 ~                ; as __x80_fp_load2 would have. Some 750 T-states where that took 1290 (ivagor, zx-pk.ru).
