 2155 2766 ~            ; that taking it off is ADD HL,BC and SBC A,D on the carry turned round. A low word of zero would
 2156 2766 ~            ; leave no carry, so then D is one less and the low word taken as 65536. The top bytes alike, the
 2157 2766 ~            ; same ADD on a copy of HL tells the rest. The quotient's bits go in at the bottom of fpx,
 2158 2766 ~            ; inverted, behind a 1 that comes out at the top when there are eight; each full byte is pushed.
 2159 2766 ~            ; Three bytes, the twenty-four bits of the result; then the round bit, bit 7, and below it only
 2160 2766 ~            ; whether anything remains, at bit 0 -- the seven bits between were computed for nothing.
