 4287 2787 ~            ; Divides the magnitudes, with the sign the result should have in bit 7 of A on entry; returns
 4288 2787 ~            ; with Z clear when the result is to stay as it is and Z set when it is to be negated.
 4289 2787 ~            __x80_signed_divide:
